"Language: fr\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

#: keyes_piano/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "PIANO"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_first_encounter/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A beauty dressed in black and gold stands before you, her eyes closed and one hand held delicately to her chest. She sways softly, silently, as though she were listening to music you can't hear."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_first_encounter/0/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The silence is so long and profound that you begin to notice just how noisy your house is—you can hear your clock ticking, your refrigerator humming, and your air conditioning blasting... has it always been so loud around here?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_first_encounter/0/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The silence persists, and this stranger continues to ignore you, lost in her own world."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_first_encounter/0/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whatever it is that she's doing... she's clearly very serious about it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_first_encounter/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Introduce yourself.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_first_encounter/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Discreetly clear your throat.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You introduce yourself, and yet still she does not open her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Try again.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>PANIC! WE NEED A MEDIC! STAT!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Finally, she opens her eyes, heaving a polite but obviously impatient sigh."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Maestro."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You had me scared for a second."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What is <i>scary</i> about a performer crafting a performance?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The performance?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It <i>was</i> coming along nicely."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What performance?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Door33_Interrupted/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ohhh... seemed like you were just standing there."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She continues to stand in stark silence, unmoving, for what feels like an eternity."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But eventually she finally, FINALLY opens her eyes, taking a grand, sweeping bow after."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/30
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>The End.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/38 keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/3
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "How was that?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How was what?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Brava! Brava!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why, the piece I just performed."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were playing? I thought you were napping."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right. Sure. Of course. I'm smart and I know stuff."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That was Door 33. Surely you recognized it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's an avant garde piano piece. Thirty-three seconds long by the composer John Gauge?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/19
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Honestly, the man was a genius."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/27
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I mean, the idea that music can exist without the presence of a single note."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/35
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Breathtaking."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/43
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You know, the very first time I played it was when I was in residence with <i>the</i> Dulce Muir."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/51
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You two have met I'm assuming?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, what the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that 'dulcimer'?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Music. I'm always talking about music."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/c-4/7 keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7 keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/Keyes_Door33/c-4/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Dulce Muir is completely different pronunciation, spelling, and comportment."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anyway, our audience that night was completely hopeless."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "They all kept waiting for the music to start, as if they couldn't already hear it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A rustling program, a muffled cough..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It was all being performed in real time, but they kept staring at Dulce and I like <i>we</i> were the philistines."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Still, it was one of my finest performances to date."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It also didn't hurt that Dulce had requested to work with me specifically."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I can't tell you just how often that seems to happen."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The talent always just seems to flock to me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Speaking of, what is that bizarre little refrain you've been playing over and over as you pass by my keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It almost seems like music, very atonal..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The jingle from the payday loan commercial?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. I think it's a repressed memory?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's Valdivian's hold music. I can't get it out of my head."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've never touched you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I have no idea what any of those words mean."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "How fascinating."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Valdivian... is he a composer?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-7/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, a company I used to work for."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-7/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I must hear his concertos when you have the time..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-7/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ah. I must say I'm rather confused now."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ah, then it was merely a wish."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-0/64/c-8/18 keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "So long, Maestro."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_Not_Interrupted/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Well, whatever you were playing I look forward to its evolution."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Maestro!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Are you here to listen to me perform?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, just looking to fall in love with you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just clicked on you by accident."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Unfortunately I have nothing to perform today... Nothing is quite ready in my repertoire."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "With me?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why not fall in love with music? It's so much easier."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "An incomprehensible dribble of words."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "On to more pressing matters though. I was hoping we could discuss my rider."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your what now?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course you would have a rider..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A rider. It is an agreement between the performer and the promoter."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm sure it's not your fault seeing as how we've never worked together, but there are certain things I require if I'm expected to give a great performance."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ohhh... you mean like champagne and caviar in your green room? That kind of thing?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay. What do you need?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This better be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Exactly, but more... consequential."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "For starters I was hoping for a little help with Hoovier."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean... Hoove?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You know the gentleman. Goes around cleaning the house with his vacuum hose, makes a terrible racket."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, was that his name?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She waves her hand dismissively."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You'll have to excuse me. I tend to cluster around the French composers lately. Still have a touch of the accent I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? I'm not picking up on an accent."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Well, that's just perfect then, isn't it! You can be my translator!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/31/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "D'accord."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/31/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Sorry, I don't know that word."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Please tell Hoovier that he needs to do something about the dust."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's awful for my pedals and any more of it and they'll begin to stick."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I really did try to explain this to him, but the language barrier was just insurmountable."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll need a bit of help with Hector too I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/32/s/0 keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0 keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is that?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you need from him?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The vents around the house, surely you know those?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Could you please talk to him about the temperature? I need it at a firm 20 degrees or it's going to wreak havoc on my tuning."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds way too cold!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must mean Celsius?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Cold? Not in celsius!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-12/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Or perhaps as we are currently outside Sweden, you know of it as the centigrade scale?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes, the only true way to measure hotness, coldness, or lack thereof."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I couldn't imagine any other way."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why doesn't Hector keep the temperature how you like it?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-5/c-14/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Honestly, I think my accent got in the way again."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-5/c-14/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Same with Lux. I like to be lit a certain way..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-6/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Lux?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-6/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lux can be difficult to get things across to."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-6/c-15/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Lux? The lights. The lamps."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-6/c-15/18
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Perhaps the light switches too, but I simply can't be bothered to check these things."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Everyone around here does seem to be a little... oh there's no better way to say it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Unrefined?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Speaking of, do we have a lighting designer on staff?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think so..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-7/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah we did, but he just left."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's alright. I was somewhat prepared for this."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My friend Celeste was on a loan to a community theatre once and she told me all about their adorable little budgets."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Now, if it's alright with you I'd like to get back to rehearsal."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/second_encounter/0/g-8/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Please do let me know what everyone says, I'm eager to jump into our work once the issues are addressed. Adieu!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Have you heard anything back from Hoovier, Hector and Lux?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I need to talk to Lux!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hoove, gotta find him."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still looking for Hector."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The lights, dearest. You simply must."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I would look in the laundry closet, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The grates - on the walls. You simply must try harder."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/Keyes_CheckIn/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Do let me know when it's all taken care of."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/12
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, good, I was hoping you'd be back soon."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/20
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Any progress on my rider?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lots of progress!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't hold my breath."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "They've... done everything I've asked? It doesn't seem like it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah no. They all refused except Hector although he did call you a 'baroness'."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They are... working on it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I know that tone of voice. Professional but hiding dark undertones between those ellipses."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What does that mean? I don't breathe at all! What did they say?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Neither Hoove, Lux nor Hector were willing to offer their help."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You have got to be joking!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-1/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "They do understand you and I are on a time schedule, right?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-1/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We are?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/c-1/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you are. I've got lots of time."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You know this is just like the time I got the lead part in 'La Vedova' and all the woodwinds pretended they were congested just to take away from my moment."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Professional jealousy. That's what this is."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's more that they didn't appreciate how you went about asking them."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My composition...?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lady, you are spouting crazy talk."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You know what, it doesn't even matter. I won't be here for much longer."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because you'll be Realized soon?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Realized? No! This is much before that is even on the table."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-2/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "How far along are you with your composition? The sooner you're done, the sooner I can get back to my department."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The project you're working on for the spring semester."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhhhh..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't write anything for any 'semester'..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Or are you writing for the fall semester?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-0/16/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I am doing nothing of the kind, merely inquiring about the status of how you are to fill me with some MUSIC!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What agreement did you have with the music department when they let you collect me?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What agreement should I have had? Asking for a friend."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Zero agreements. Nothing."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Big agreements. The best agreement. Everyone loves our agreements."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A friend?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/c-5/15/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You and I both know you have very few of those."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What on earth..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My understanding was that they loaned me out to an emerging composer in the theatre department — you — to be returned at the completion of your project."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did someone actually say that? Because I don't think I got that memo."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "No one <i>needed</i> to say anything. Why else would the music department loan out their star performer?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Besides, you're obviously an immensely talented artist. I mean this space alone is perfect."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thank you. I think it turned out pretty nicely."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? It's just my living room."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I've never seen a set fully capture the bleak existence of a lonely American working from home."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Spot on..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-3/c-8/23/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That was a compliment, Maestro."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's a phenomenal set. I'm sure it's serving up all kinds of inspiration."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Or did you build it to actually be a part of your performance?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Immersive theatre is having <i>such</i> a resurgence. I always said it would."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Now, are you thinking the audience will wander from room to room as we play or will you have them do that prior to the performance?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You really haven't shared much about the production with me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's because I'm not a composer."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I haven't shared it because a composer always keeps their secrets!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/c-9/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Nonsense. Of course you are."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I work in customer service. Or, used to."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/c-9/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That makes no sense. Why would the music department lend me to you then?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/c-10/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Hm. I don't believe you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-4/40/c-10/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Did the music department lend me to you or not?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They didn't. You were a hand-me-down."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What is that, German?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What's a <i>'Hanmedaun'</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She gasps, placing a hand to her chest."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/31
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, wait, don't tell me, it's an award, isn't it? Some sort of lifetime achievement?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/39
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh my God. I can't believe I'm going to be a Hanmedaun recipient."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think you're quite getting what it means to be hand-me-down."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>Hanmedaun</i>."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/50/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>HAND-ME-DOWN</i>."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/50/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You know it's the strangest thing, but it sounds like you're saying \"HAND ME DOWN?\""
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/50/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-6/c-11/50/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But, that's not German at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-7/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, Keyes, it isn't. I never learned how to play you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-7/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "EXACTLY!!!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm so confused."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A hand-me-down is an item that, after a period of extended use, gets passed on to someone else so that <i>they</i> can use it as well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes stares at you, unblinking and silent. You can almost see the gears turning inside her head."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. Imagine you're a piece of gum."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not explaining this to you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What flavor?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does it matter?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cherry."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Black licorice."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Piano."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I had a freshman who used to stick cherry flavored gum to my underside every time he came in to practice."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bad memories?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that is a compliment to you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, not at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Once I got past the indignity I found I was rather partial to the flavor."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I agree. It was free gum after all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "OK. Then imagine you're a piece of cherry-flavored gum."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/g-0/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Mmmm. Deeply cherry."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-8/c-14/20/c-0/15/g-0/8/g-0/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My flavor speaks to the muses above!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The music department chewed you up, but instead of spitting you out, they determined that you still had enough flavor left and they passed you on to the next person."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's unhygienic."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's an analogy."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Wherein <i>I</i> am the chewing gum?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/0/s/0 keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Correct."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I thought you somehow knew."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But that implies the music department no longer had any use for me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But that makes no sense. I worked there for fifteen years. I was a star performer. And now I just don't work there anymore?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Am I at least still on campus? The movers threw a blanket over me and the next thing I knew I was in this room. At least tell me this is the theater department."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. You're at my house."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-9/c-15/18/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's the 'theater department' of my house, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Alright. So when does a hand-me-down technically get handed back up?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They don't. They only ever get handed down."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "And you're sure you're not a composer."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Positive."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nuh-uh."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Because you trail around in your robe and underwear quite a bit. That's not part of some creative process?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/15/c-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Though the fantastic red shirt you wear does strike me as rather artistic..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a fashion choice."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-10/c-16/15/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm comfortable - so what!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Alright. You don't have to be a composer."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Perhaps you're a wealthy connoisseur of the arts?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not wealthy."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a connoisseur"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a wealthy connoisseur of the arts."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am a wealthy connoisseur of the arts!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/keyesjoincomposer/c-20/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Only someone who isn't would say something so gauche."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "So what you're telling me is that not only did I get handed down without my knowledge, I also have no job, no musical prospects, no financial prospects, you're not a composer and this is my home now."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-11/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "In a nutshell."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-11/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-11/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you ready to fall in love with me now?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes gives you a pleasant smile."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/post_keyes_quest/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Fantastic. Would you please excuse me. I'm going to go scream in the highest octave I can manage."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why, hello there, Maestro."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem not devastated by recent events."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keyes, are you doing okay?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's because I've chosen to make the best out of a terrible situation."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Since you're not the famed composer you led me to believe you were."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait a minute. <i>You</i> made that assumption."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>Since you're not the famed composer you led me to believe you were... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes. Perfectly fine now."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I've decided that <i>I</i> will be writing my own music instead."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There's no reason for me to waste away in obscurity just because I was forcibly retired."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm equipped, I have the training and I have the discipline."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why shouldn't it be me?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I've decided to channel my rage into a program piece."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm calling it Keyes' Piano Sonata No. 1 in D. Minor, \"Capriccio Infernal\"."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh, sexy title."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you haven't dealt with your disappointment yet..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't 'capriccio' a type of deli meat?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Merely following classical naming conventions."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A 'caprice' is a loose term for the form - merely hinting that this music will have a lively, virtuosic character."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It follows the goddess Piana, the most favoured daughter of the sky god, as she's unfairly cast from the heavens down into the mortal realm."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sooo... autobiographical?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/7 keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I don't know what you mean."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm a piano, not a sky goddess unfairly cast from the heavens down into the mortal realm."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anyway, the entire thing focuses on her attempts to get back home."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd watch that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever you gotta do to process your feelings."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know you live here now. There's no going back to your old existence."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/c-0/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Watch... perhaps in the theater of your mind? I would prefer you listen."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/c-1/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It has nothing to do with my feelings. I was inspired by reading something very much like it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Reading what?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, Keyes, sure."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A book or what have you. A poem maybe."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/8/c-0/31/c-2/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "They know not of what they speak..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I just started working on the first movement. That's where we'll meet the characters, establish musical themes, etcetera."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Right now, Piana has just woken up in a forest to find her wings bloody and broken."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "She stumbles to the nearest village, but none of the people there will assist her, despite the fact that she did ask very nicely and is very pretty."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It would appear that they are jealous of her status as a deity."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this about Hoove, Hector, and Lux refusing to help you?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't know classical music can have stories? I thought there weren't any words."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I have no idea what you're talking about - Piana lives far away from these... quotidian modern objects."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Piana decides she doesn't need their help and sets out to find the most famed magician to help her mend her wings."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please tell me I'm the famed magician..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fascinating story."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anyway, Piana finally finds the magician only to discover that he was a fraud and can't do any magic at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anyway, Piana finally finds the magician only to discover that she was a fraud and can't do any magic at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/17/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anyway, Piana finally finds the magician only to discover that they are a fraud and can't do any magic at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/20/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "GASP! THAT CHARLATAN!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/20/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This feels like libel, but I'm invested."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-5/23/c-0/20/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Magic's actually really hard to do, thank you very much."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "This would be 'program music' - the themes and developments happen through use of leitmotifs and tell a preconceived story."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-6/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "In contrast to 'absolute music' which is more abstract."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I knew that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Learn something new every day..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-1/9/c-6/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Of course you did, Maestro."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "So now Piana's trapped in the mortal realm far away from everyone she holds dear."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh. What happens next?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Keyes. I know this adjustment can't be easy."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not true! She's got the hot magician."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-9/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I never said anything about the magician's attractiveness."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-9/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "OK, but if you had to..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-9/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Fine. The charlatan magician is of moderate attractiveness."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-9/21/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I knew it!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-9/21/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sick."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-9/21/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The magician is not sickly."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "This all happens in the first part of the sonata — the exposition."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I think I'd like to build on the sinister theme in the second movement. Right now it's all lacking a bit of bite."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/third_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Leave me. I have composing to do and I need my space."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'd like to be upgraded to another room, please."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong with this one?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Up until recently, only three things."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "As of this morning, I've discovered a fourth."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course you have."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are the other three things?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it the roach? It's the roach, isn't it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "'Of course'?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Do you think I'm picky about which room I'm in? About the environment?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I do."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... not at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I am. I am glad you know me well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A liar, then. Hmph."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The ones I sent you out to fix that are <i>still</i> making things rather difficult for me to play!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I did not know of any roaches and now I am dreadfully frightened that they could be present here."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "No, the fourth wrong thing here is... well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>It's Telly.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm... I guess it makes sense that you two would clash."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The <i>television</i>, dear."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "He's in my direct line of sight and that simply won't work for me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "He's a menace, a distraction and he's sabotaging my sonata."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Do you know what he did this morning?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, but I'm guessing you're about to tell me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Was he on non-stop?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "He was on <i>non-stop</i>. And I mean non-stop."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You try holding a tune in your head with all of that color and sound flashing at you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Before I was even fully awake I'd been subjected to a breakfast show!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, shoot. I wanted to watch that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like a hardship."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not so bad, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-5/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-6/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Very much so!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-7/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Subjected to a breakfast show? That's <i>very</i> bad."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There was quippy banter, a cooking segment, and a human-interest story about a three-legged crossing guard dog named Champ."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Then came the local news where I learned that apparently there's a cat burglar on the loose."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, no. In our neighborhood?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's just normal television, Keyes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I doubt it. It looked nice."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-8/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-8/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There's no shame in being poor, darling."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What was I saying?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were ranting."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-10/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "After the local news I had to watch a game show! Then a two-dimensional 'cartoon'."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Nowhere was there any of the classics being played. Nowhere was there a piano, cello, nor harp to be found."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "In fact... the entire time this was happening there were non-stop commercial breaks for the same payday loan company which can only mean one thing."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That you've got the jingle stuck in your head?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It is the lowest form of musical composition I have ever heard."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You take that back! It's a masterpiece."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you hum the mattress jingle it'll get rid of the payday jingle."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Masterpieces have 'Opus' in the title."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "JINGLES HAVE NO TITLES NOR OPUS NUMBERS."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But then won't I just have the mattress jingle stuck in my head?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/pianojoin/c-11/18/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not a perfect science."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's fine. Because that wasn't even the worst part of my day."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The worst part of my day happened with the opening notes of that inane soap opera 'Sands of Time.'"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "DUN DUN DUUUUUUUUUN."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love me a soap opera."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oof. My deepest sympathies."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/c-12/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The wrong key, dearest, but I understand the intent."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It was the most ridiculous forty minutes of my life."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Time I could have been using to write my sonata."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There was seduction, scandal and this lady named Sharlene pushed her twin off a cliff and then went home to sleep with her husband..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Er, the twin's husband. The sister. The dead sister."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Who turned out not to have died from the cliff which just seems impossible!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/40
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I can't believe I spent my entire day on this nonsense!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly that sounds like a pretty fun day."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would you like me to talk to Telly about keeping it down?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened with Sharlene and the husband?!?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/c-15/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I know! That's the problem."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-6/c-17/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's what <i>I'd</i> like to know!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm confused. I thought you hated everything that happened."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It means that there might be hope for you after all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's definitely an interesting development."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It means you're a lady of leisure now and you can do what you want."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-18/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I did!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-18/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It was the most fun I've had in a while and it had nothing to do with music."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-18/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Also, I'm not sure what it means that I neglected my sonata to watch television all day!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-19/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Hope? No! I want sturm <i>and</i> drang!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-20/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "No, a subdominant in the minor key is an interesting development."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-20/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "This is just sad."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-7/c-21/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ladies of leisure go to the symphony - I want to be on stage performing!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "And now I'm going to be forced to watch 'Sands of Time' tomorrow as well to find out what's going to happen next."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I feel hoodwinked."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "'Soap Opera' has the word 'opera' in it, but it isn't musical at all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/32
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Do you think Telly would let me watch the next episode tomorrow?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably. Just ask him. <i>Nicely.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But we're not really friends and I'm a complete stranger to him."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Everyone here already knows each other."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then introduce yourself."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Today is a great day to fix that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, better just give up now."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/c-2/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Good point."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/c-2/21
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll just... ignore the programs that Telly plays, and get back to work."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "And then what?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. Make small talk, be friendly."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do all the stuff you'd do as if you were trying to be friends with someone."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/c-0/7 keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She nods slowly."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>Be friendly... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>Friends... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have had friends before, haven't you?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Friends' seems like a foreign concept to you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-8/c-22/23/g-0/8/g-0/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I have never had 'friends'."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I've had colleagues I admired to the point of crippling jealousy."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's kind of like being friends."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you care about them?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you want to spend time with them?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "God no."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you root for their success?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You don't \"root\" for the competition."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You rip off their heads and paint the inside of your soundboard with their blood."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That is the single hottest thing I have ever heard."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I steal that for a tattoo?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Remind me to stay on your good side."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "...good."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/23/c-1/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ugh... be my guest."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-9/c-23/15/c-0/18/c-0/23/c-2/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You should always be on my good side."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I don't want to do that with Telly though, but I'm not sure how to go about it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Easy. Just tell him you'd like to be friends."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell him how much you enjoyed watching him all day."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stare at him until he decides to be your friend."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-24/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's it?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-24/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-25/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Isn't that a little creepy? I've never even talked to him."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-25/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you're lucky he'll be into it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-25/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "And if I'm not?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-25/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then it's gonna be real embarrassing for you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-25/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What a great help you are."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-25/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just call me the Friend Whisperer."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-26/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Aggressive, forward..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-10/c-26/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I LOVE IT!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "If he says it's alright and I can watch a few more shows, do I have your permission to do that before I get back to my sonata?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-11/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are you asking me for permission?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-11/c-27/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm not sure..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-11/c-27/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My days at the music department were always so busy it just seems like I should be asking someone before I spend hours doing nothing."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "However you want to spend your time is up to you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't call it doing nothing. Someone's gotta tell me what happens on 'Sands of Time.'"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If watching tv all day makes you happy then you should do it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, you should always ask me before doing anything."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/c-28/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's... a relief."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/c-29/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll be sure to."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/c-30/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Perhaps... perhaps I will for a little while."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/c-31/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-12/c-31/21 keyes_piano/fourth_encounter/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Thanks, Maestro."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/10/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ah... Maestro... Always good to see you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ah... it's you. Hello."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/12/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh. I didn't think you would be coming back with how you have been speaking with me. A pleasant surprise."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How'd it go with Telly?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I tried to ignore it... but I just couldn't! I had to speak with Telly."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I think it went well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/11
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I wasn't sure where to start so I just told him how much I'd enjoyed watching all the shows I'd watched and... well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/19
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Everything after that came pretty easily."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/27
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "We talked about the house, and Sands of Time. He even gave me a few plot pointers for my sonata."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like it was friendly then."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It does, doesn't it..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Would one say that he and I are friends now?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Or is there a ritual at this point to complete the process?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're adorable."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a blood sacrifice that needs to happen to the house gods."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It could definitely be the <i>start</i> of a friendship."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-0/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm... just new to this. That's all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-1/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Say the name and I'll take them out!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa! You wanna take a moment and think about it?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why? Death comes for us all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-1/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was kidding, Keyes. No one needs to be sacrificed."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/7 keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh. OK."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Death still comes for us all though."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/35/c-0/31/c-2/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A start... Like the exposition in a sonata form."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I think I realized something else while I was talking to Telly."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That I might like to be friends with you as well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "If you'll have me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I might like to be friends with you too, Keyes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! Another victim of my irresistible charm."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought we already were friends."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "If we are, then I'm afraid I haven't been very good to you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/23/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Telly was telling me about this documentary on landfills and how people throw away all kinds of things including pianos."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I know you aren't the composer you led me to believe you were..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That wasn't me, that was you!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>I know you aren't the composer you led me to believe you were... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But, I'm glad that I'm sitting here instead of on a pile of trash and severed limbs."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. You lost me with the limbs."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do enjoy your company, Keyes, even if I don't know how to play you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Telly was telling me that in the documentary, dead bodies ended up in the dump all the time."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Because they got murdered."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Brutally."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I picked up on that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yet."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I can always teach you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would love that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-2/23/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "After my sonata..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anyway, I stand before you now declaring my thanks and announcing my intention to be a friend to you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Did I do that right?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You're supposed to announce your intention to be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are. So that all in the land may know your heart."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're supposed to seal it with a kiss on each cheek, but we can do that some other time."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's technically a little dance you do first, but I'll let it slide."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-3/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I hope they all do!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-4/13/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes... some other time I would be delighted to."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-4/14/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Hmmm. I could be tempted, you know."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-4/15/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "We are very far from that sort of business being on the table, I'll have you know."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-5/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I was never one for dancing..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Can I ask you a personal question?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what friends do."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why didn't you get something new and shiny? Why a hand-me-down?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would have if I'd had the money."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't want anything else after I saw you. You were perfect."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "New and shiny, doesn't always mean good."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh. I suppose that makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Thank you for saying that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I suppose that's true."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh. I guess friends don't do that. I'm deeply sorry."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Well, I have a soap opera to catch up on and a sonata to write."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll see you around, friend."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/6/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, my goodness, I always get so fluttery when you come by. Could I run something by you for the sonata?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh, good. Could I run something by you for the sonata?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh. You're here. Still."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/11
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm afraid I've hit a bit of a creative wall."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you want <i>my</i> help?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you're in the middle of the room!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's nothing technical. I'd just like a second opinion."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. Lay it on me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do my best..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A creative wall is very different from a physical wall."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "When we last left off, Piana, famous and beautiful shunned goddess, had been travelling the mortal realm trying to find a way back home."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The charlatan magician she'd first sought out is now accompanying her, by the way."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean the magician <i>HEAVILY</i> inspired by me?!?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about... but yes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/15/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The magician is now a key player since Piana discovered that there is more to him than she initially thought."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/16/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The magician is now a key player since Piana discovered that there is more to her than she initially thought."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/17/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The magician is now a key player since Piana discovered that there is more to them than she initially thought."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/20/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Such as?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The magician knows the realm and its inhabitants better than Piana could ever hope to and as such has helped Piana make personal connections."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "As it turns out, the magician isn't terrible company. Piana has come to enjoy his chats as they travel along, but this is where I hit a wall."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/9/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "As it turns out, the magician isn't terrible company. Piana has come to enjoy her chats as they travel along, but this is where I hit a wall."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/10/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "As it turns out, the magician isn't terrible company. Piana has come to enjoy their chats as they travel along, but this is where I hit a wall."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The story has always been about Piana getting back home."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/21
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Action, adventure, vengeance. But... I've been toying with the idea of a romantic subplot..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/29
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Between the magician and Piana."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I say focus on the path you're on. None of that kissy stuff."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, hell yeah! Mash their faces together!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-1/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think the magician might enjoy the plot development."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There's one more thing."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'd like to lodge a formal complaint against another member of the household."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Again? I'm gonna have to start charging."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We should really turn this into a drinking game."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Were the first four complaints not enough?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course, who is it this time? I'll get it sorted."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You can take it out of my stipend."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A disgusting suggestion!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I am a piano of many complaints. Would you care to see how many?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure - how many?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I can go up to 88."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Now. This one."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's against Rainey."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rainey? But you're both musical."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The record player - just down the sight-line into the dining room."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes... we are cut from different cloths, but both musical in nature."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "She was playing something classical the other day."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/8/s/0 keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There was a piano part."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "As resident piano, that should have been my responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My role was usurped and I'd like to place the record in question on the list of banned music."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Since when has there been a list of banned music?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got it. Banning that record forever."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I just started one."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The other option of course would be to have her play the record over and over again..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait... isn't that the last thing you'd want?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-5/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what you really want is to hear it again."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-5/c-14/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Well, it was actually quite a lovely piece and it caught my ear and gave me an idea for the composition."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes... That would be fantastic."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-6/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This doesn't actually sound like a complaint, Keyes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh I don't know. Old habits die hard."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll go introduce myself."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/sixth_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Thanks for the kind ear."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Have you ever got so swept up in your work, you completely lost all sense of time?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Every waking moment..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only when a deadline is staring me right in the face."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish. I have the attention span of a ferret."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Then you'll understand my excitement..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "That's how I've felt!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Well then pay attention to this!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why? What's happening?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I FINISHED THE CONCERTO!!!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She holds a small booklet out to you, beside herself with excitement."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought it was a sonata..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Congratulations!!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes... it was."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A sonata is a solo piece... meant for just the piano alone."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But then Rainey and I started talking and that record player is like a walking encyclopedia of music."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/31
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I mean, there's nothing she doesn't know."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/39
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "She played me so many records that by the end I was just bursting with ideas."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/47
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You have excellent taste in music by the way."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "After spending time with Rainey, I came back and sat down and it all just poured out of me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "From sonata - to concerto. A true repartee between solo piano and a full orchestra of friends!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My very first composition, fully complete!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I've played it a few times from start to finish and it's safe to say that I don't hate it. At all."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It's captured everything I wished to put to music."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's great! Are you letting anyone listen to it yet?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I was hoping to."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But, do you think anyone would want to hear me play? I'm afraid I may have been something of a diva when I first arrived."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/23/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But, I did apologize to Hoove, Lux, and Hector."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure you don't have anything to worry about."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/seventh_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/26/c-0/13
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Then... here we go. I'll go get dressed."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/18
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And away we go! Time to see the show!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/26
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Though hearing music without a screen seems a <i>little</i> obscene!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/34
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "<i>Ah damn, Telly - no wild rhyming during the old school music! Remember what happened last time... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/45/b/4
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "A concerto? I can't remember the last time I heard one of those."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/45/b/15
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I hope this is better than those modern concerts that Bodhi used to put on..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/48/b/4
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Finally, I get to sit down for a bit and take in a performance!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/51/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I detest music but I do like costumes..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/54/b/4
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm so happy to be parked in my very own corner. The best seat in the house!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/60
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes is dressed in a floor-length gown that makes her look even more elegant and grand than she already does. She is absolutely stunning."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey enters just after her, dressed in a charming tuxedo."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/79
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Here you go, honey! I've brought my finest duds and my highest quality speakers to capture all those dynamics you classical musicians wanna hear!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/90
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Thank you, friends, for everything."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/0/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe we got this far!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/1/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How long is this thing gonna be?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/2/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there a program or something I can use as a guide?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/3/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm taking my seat!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-0/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I could not have done this without you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-1/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ten minutes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-1/15/0/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so long."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-1/15/1/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm in! Can't wait."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-1/15/c-0/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You don't have to stay if it's too much for you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-1/15/c-0/15 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Some of the finest and most outrageous compositions had the audience walk out on their premieres at first..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I did write a little something up... well. A lot of something."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/15 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Do you want to have a read?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/26 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You have a quick scan of the program. The text is... lengthy... and not the most accessible."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/34 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You consider for a moment. Do you truly wish to spend the next ten minutes or so reading this program?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/0/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/1/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll take a look afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "\"The piano is a monster that screams when you touch its teeth.\" — Antray Segovia"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/15 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "While such words may seem to lovers of the romantic repertoire a bit outré, even outrageous, the Capriccio Infernal reminds one of just how puckish and recalcitrant the queen of instruments can be."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/23 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Like the best concertos, at its heart the piece is a contest between soloist and ensemble, the former wickedly eager to upend the status quo."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/31 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "We sense this agon from the opening bars. Strings weave a cryptic, serpentine motif over lumbering woodwinds, apprehensive of the bombast to come."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/39 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When the piano unleashes its gale of diabolical runs, the brass section, tempest tossed, struggles to maintain balance above the fray."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/47 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rudely awoken, the orchestra marshals all its forces to declaim the first theme, the piano punctuating it with enormous, leaping two-handed chords like an enfant terrible heckling a hellfire sermon."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/55 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/55
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A brief, smirking nod to fin de siècle Vienna, and the piano snatches up the main theme for itself while the orchestra is condemned to breathless ritornello."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/63 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/63
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Here the soloist resembles nothing so much as an elemental trickster — an imp gamboling from rooftop to rooftop, conjuring a storm to light its way. Roaring. Mercurial. Playful. Dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/71 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Andante's second theme, however, slows this deluge to a trickle. Two erudite, would-be lovers talk in circles around their feelings for each other, elegant but anxious, laughing awkwardly at little in-jokes while puzzling out how to initiate a kiss."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/79
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "(Listeners are wise to note the intimately espressivo coda - is its dazzling return en tutti at the end a triumph, or a surrender?)"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/87 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/87
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Following this chanson-like respite from the mad inferno, the development section opens a veritable Pandora’s box of quips, quotations, and musical bon mots."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/95 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/95
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Is that a barcarolle interrupting the blistering descending line? Has the first theme been twisted into the specter of a saltarello? The second theme ransacked for a gigue?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/103 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/103
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The piano gallops ahead, heedless of our questions, to a whirling cadenza with its teeth bared."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/111 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/111
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When at last we arrive at the recapitulation, the orchestra has warmed considerably to the piano’s sense of humor. Or has the soloist's ferocity hounded the whole into a parliament of jesters?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/119 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/119
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Soloist, orchestra. Individual, society. Infernal, angelic. Searing, soft. Arch, earnest. These opposing forces form of this piece a writhing musical caduceus. To tackle its monstrous technical demands is to tempt a beast as ravenous as it is cunning."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/127 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/127
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But the spoils are great."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/135 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/135
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Perhaps Segovia’s bête noir cannot be tamed. But neither, if respected, can it fail to astound."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/143
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whew. What a ride."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/151 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/143
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Exciting, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/159/0/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/151/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm... overwhelmed."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/159/1/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/151/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm tantalized!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/159/c-0/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/151/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Wait til you hear the piece..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-2/42/c-0/159/c-1/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/151/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm excited for you to peer inside!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/99/8/c-3/7 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Excellent. So am I."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Rainey?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "On me!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/32 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/17/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes and Rainey begin to play, each in beautiful harmony with the other."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You sit back to take in the waves of music..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/63 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>Strings weave a cryptic, serpentine motif over lumbering woodwinds, apprehensive of the bombast to come.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/74 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>When the piano unleashes its gale of diabolical, Mendelssohn-esque runs, the brass section, tempest tossed, struggles to maintain balance above the fray.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/85 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>Rudely awoken, the orchestra marshals all its forces to declaim the first theme, the piano punctuating it with enormous, leaping two-handed chords a la Tchaikovsky like an enfant terrible heckling a hellfire sermon.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/96 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/73
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>Here the soloist resembles nothing so much as an elemental trickster – an imp gamboling from rooftop to rooftop, conjuring a storm to light its way.  Roaring. Mercurial. Playful. Dangerous. Only the violins are able to keep up.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/107 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/84
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The bridge, divided into three playfully lopsided sub sections, parades through a deluge of keys.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/118 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/95
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The andante second theme slows this deluge to a trickle. Gershwinian panache mingles with Poulenc at his most tender.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/129 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/106
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>It’s as if two erudite, would-be lovers are talking in circles around their feelings for each other...</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/140 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/117
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>...elegant but anxious, laughing awkwardly at little in-jokes while puzzling out how to initiate a kiss.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/151 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/128
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The andante’s coda - is it a victory, or a surrender?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/162 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/139
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The lover’s theme over, we now slink cautiously back toward the opening’s sinister tone.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/173 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/150
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The puckish laughter returns. The piano makes a noble effort to keep things bright, yet...</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/184 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/161
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>A storm erupts - electric, saturnine, dizzying.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/195 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/172
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>Following a chanson-like respite from the mad tumult, the development section opens a veritable Pandora’s box of quips, quotations, and musical bon mots.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/206 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/183
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>Is that a barcarolle breaking through the squall? Has the first theme been twisted into the specter of a saltarello? The second theme ransacked for a gigue?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/217 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/194
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The piano gallops ahead to a whirling cadenza with its teeth bared as the orchestra bows out.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/228 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/205
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>When we arrive at the recapitulation, the other players have at last warmed to the piano’s devilish sense of humor. Or has the soloist's ferocity simply hounded them into submission?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/239 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/216
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>The andante theme’s glorious return now sees the lovers embrace heartily, all inhibitions gone. The strings soar. The piano shimmers and stomps in triumph.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/250 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/227
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>One last fit of laughter, and we end with a wry nod to the opening theme, bright and rambling as if to say, “On to the next!”</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/261 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/238
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You listen as long as you like, allowing the music to wash over you and transport you into Keyes' fantastic world."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-0/283/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/260/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Finish listening.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concert_begin/0/g-1/15 keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/g-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Thank you for letting me sing at last..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what you've been working on?!?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "From start to finish."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I couldn't have done it without you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me? What did I do?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You made me feel at home, or rather, you gave me a home."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I don't know if you noticed, but I made some changes to the narrative."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Piana ends up staying in the mortal realm with the magician."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You were the inspiration for the magician, by the way."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me something I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was?!?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I was. I'm a natural born muse."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Cheeky..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You didn't pick up on that? I knew I hid it well."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Oh you..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Did you like what I did with Piana and the magician's relationship?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like that they remained friends. We don't get enough friendship stories."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I liked the romantic subplot. I think those two make a great match."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_afterconcert/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought it was predictable and boring. Saw it coming from a mile away."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "...and what about the real Piana and her magician?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Do they make a great match?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think they make a very good match."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I think I want to write a lot more pieces about them..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know where to find me if you need inspiration."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we can write it together."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me know if you need me to pose nude for that."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Wrong medium, but I appreciate your enthusiasm."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Maybe we can even play it together."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would love nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes... as collaborators."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My love..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "...that was always the intention."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Always..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I like that we were able to remain friends. Despite your lack of artistic renown."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I couldn't have asked for a better second home."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Though, please stop walking around in your robe and underwear."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll have you know my comfy chic ensembles are just as artistically renowned around here."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll get used to it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, go write a sonata about it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You've taught me a lot of things. Perhaps this, too."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "A muse for a dreary outfit! I like it!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll be seeing you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm sorry... did you just..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "<i>GIVE ME A BAD REVIEW?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/22
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Because that sounded like a bad review and I will have you know that not once in my life have I ever been reviewed poorly!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just calling it like I saw it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What, it's constructive criticism."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't say the entire thing was bad."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My performances have been lauded as 'inspired', 'angelic', 'must-see events —' and you just called my work <i>PREDICTABLE?!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "PREDICTABLE!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Well, I predict that you and I will never speak again."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/g-0/61
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Your relationship was out of tune from the start."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate/0/g-0/69
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Music to my ears."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes quickly changes into her concert gown once more."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Anything before we begin?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/8/c-2/39/c-0/79
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "(Listeners are wise to note the intimately espressvio coda - is its dazzling return en tutti at the end a triumph, or a surrender?)"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/0/b/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey arrives, dressed in her tuxedo and ready to perform."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_concerto_return/0/keyesconcertbegin2/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You sit back and take in the waves of music..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/3
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My darling... You've come to take in the sight of your rapturous lover?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/11
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Or did you want to hear my concerto once more?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Written any new pieces about me?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/20/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's hear your concerto!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/21/s/0 keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you ready to be Realized?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I would if you gave me something to write about."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Why don't we start by me showing you a few bars..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The music she plays is the food of love. When you are full, you part ways wistfully."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_return/0/c-1/7 keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Allow me to get prepared..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "My erstwhile collaborator returns..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/6
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ah, my friend, the human."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi, Keyes, what can I get for ya?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just coming by to say hello."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'd like to register a complaint against a fellow member of the household."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're joking!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I AM!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You should have seen your face!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll see you around."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Hello, friend."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'll get back to practice, then."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_friend_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She gives you a smile as you let her play. You stay long and listen."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Don't even think about putting those grubby fingers on me."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll have to go grub someplace else then..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So, what did you think of my false review? (USE SMARTS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "False review? That phrase is devoid of meaning."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's true! When I gave you a bad review, it was to spur you to greater heights!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "You thought that by obfuscating your true thoughts, that I would struggle more to do even better next time?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "What an outrageously heinous idea."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "They say we always remember the bad reviews. And yours certainly has been a thorn in my sound board."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I must admit I have been composing even more fiercely than before."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "If you say it was all to push me further, suffer more for my art, then I suppose I must thank you."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends, then?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "We can be friends, yes. Collaborators."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Though I will keep my distance."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Alive?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I suppose I can give it a try."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Have you practiced?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_join/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've practiced just enough."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_join/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I need to take more lessons."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It takes time, but the effort is worth it."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Ah, is it time to try out this 'living' idea?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Practice makes perfect."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not yet, I'm afraid..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Then I have more time to compose here..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Can Realization work on someone as classy as Keyes? I'm nervous!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Maestro please..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a piano, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes is beautifully human, but she doesn't seem all that excited. She looks down at her body with a calculating gaze."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I stand here... alive..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Being human is very..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes claps her hands, stomps her feet, and sings a few notes."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/41
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Unmusical."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you disappointed?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, Keyes..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It is of no importance..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Because I can dedicate these fingers of mine to their highest function."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "The keys."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes sits down at the piano she just moments ago inhabited, and begins to play."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Yes! Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess you found your highest love after all..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_realized/0/g-0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about we make sweet music with your lips as well?"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Absolutely, we may."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "But only with you on top of the piano."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Somewhat ungainfully, you climb on top of the baby grand and kiss Keyes as she tickles her own ivories."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_divert/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The accompaniment she plays ebbs and swells with the love between you both, creating a divine music that underscores each and every feeling, each and every breath."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It is divine."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Sadly, even Keyes tires of playing the single piano in your household, and she moves out to do something even grander."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She quickly plays every piano she sees, finding more and more acclaim as a concert pianist without even trying very hard."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But being on stage with merely one piano was not enough for her..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/24
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I'm going to surround myself with pianos, and surround the world with me!"
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keyes buys a grand mansion on a rocky outcrop with 10 rooms, each dedicated to a different type of keyboard instrument: piano, clavichord, spinet, harpsichord, organ..."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And quickly sets up a variety of streaming equipment to give seminars, concerts, and music appreciation lectures daily - inspiring a generation of musicians and concert-goers into the deep and wonderful world of symphonic music."
msgstr ""

#: keyes_piano/keyes_love_join/48
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Again - molto vivace!"
msgstr ""
